    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This impressive south facing two bed apartment is presented in pristine condition and is located within this highly regarded, mature development on the Howth Road.\r\n\r\nBerehaven is an established, carefully maintained development close to the many amenities of Raheny Village and the nearby coast.  The development comprises a mix of tastefully designed apartments and townhouses set in beautifully kept communal gardens.\r\n\r\nSituated on the ground floor, the apartment offers generously proportioned accommodation comprising an entrance hallway leading through to an open plan kitchen and dining area, with ample space for dining and entertaining.  There is also a comfortable sized living area which opens directly onto a spacious outdoor terrace overlooking mature planting and landscaped gardens.   The two double bedrooms are quietly positioned to the rear of the apartment.  Both bedrooms have fitted wardrobes, and the principal bedroom has the added benefit of an en-suite shower room.  A stylish family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property comes with one designated car parking space as well as visitor parking.\r\n\r\nRaheny Village is within easy reach and offers a desirable combination of village charm and convenient access to the city centre. A wide range of everyday amenities are within easy reach, while the DART and numerous bus routes provide excellent connectivity to the city and surrounding areas.  Nearby St Anne’s Park and the coastal promenade offer plenty of opportunities for walking, cycling and enjoying the outdoors.\r\n\r\nThis apartment will appeal to those searching for something a little bit special in a prime residential location.\r\n\r\nContact JB Kelly on 01 8393400 to arrange an appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n2.65 x 1.20m + 1.65 x 2.45m\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway with recently replaced carpet. Recessed lighting. Shelved hot press.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining / Living Area\r\nExpansive open plan space with direct access to outdoor patio.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 6.35 x 2.70m\r\nExtensive range of floor and wall mounted presses with polished stone countertop and splash back.\r\nTiled floors. Integrated oven, hob with extractor over, fridge freezer, microwave, dishwasher, washing machine.\r\n\r\nLiving Room: 3.80 x 4.00m + 1.65 x 1.75m\r\nComfortable sized living area with access to terrace.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.80 x 3.35m + 0.85 x 1.00m\r\nDouble sized bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite\r\n1.75 x 1.50m\r\nWC, WHB and cubicle shower. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.25 x 2.65m (at widest point).\r\nDouble sized bedroom with fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.85 x 1.95m\r\nWC, WHB, bath. Part-tiled walls and flooring."
      },
      {
